cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use leakseed, please cite it as below."
title: leakseed
abstract: >-
  A seeded corpus of look-ahead leaks in backtest code, in leak/clean twin pairs whose
  labels are verified by a causality oracle, with an independent scorecard of static
  leakage linters using template-clustered intervals and tests.
type: software
authors:
  - name: h-a-forster
repository-code: "https://github.com/h-a-forster/leakseed"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-06"
keywords:
  - backtesting
  - look-ahead bias
  - data leakage
  - static analysis
  - linter benchmark
  - seeded bugs
